  "comments": "<p>This coin was first issued into circulation in 2006. It was replacing the old larger heavier copper-nickel version of the 50 cent coin first issued in 1967. The Reserve Bank of NZ &amp; the NZ Post Office issued a Limited Edition special set of coins called <strong>\"Small Change Smaller Change\"</strong> to celebrate the redesign of this coin and the 10 &amp; 20 cent coins and the removal of the 5 cent coin.<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/601a316cd6c77.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/601a316cd6c77.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/601a317c818b9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/601a317c818b9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/601a318cb9b0e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/601a318cb9b0e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/601a31a27c39e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/601a31a27c39e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/601a31b227d9e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/601a31b227d9e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/601a31c4c9f65.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/601a31c4c9f65.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>2015 &amp; 2018 mintage figures:</i><br>It has been confirmed by the RBNZ Statistics Team that the total circulating coin production for 2015 was 12.7 million 50 cent pieces comprising 1 million ANZAC Centenary commemoratives and 11.7 million Endeavour definitives. This is the same for 2018; 6 million 50 cent pieces were minted, comprising 2 million Armistice Centenary commemoratives and 4 million Endeavour definitives.</p>",
